			<attribute key="id" type="int">0</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Suppose the integer P=5, what do we have to check in the array?
Option1: How many numbers are greater than the number 5 in the array.
Option2: At least 5 numbers must be greater than 5 in the array.
Option3: Exactly 5 numbers should be greater than the number 5.</attribute>
